    "pregnancy": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: داده‌های رجیستری بارداری افزایش نقص مادرزادی نسبت به جمعیت عمومی نشان نمی‌دهد.",
        "en": "Label: pregnancy registry data show no increase in birth defects over the background rate."
      },
      "quote": "Available data from the APR show no difference in the overall risk of birth defects for lamivudine compared with the background rate for birth defects of 2.7% in the Metropolitan Atlanta Congenital Defects Program (MACDP) reference population.",
