        "en": "Label: use with caution in older adults, usually starting at the low end of the dose range."
      },
      "quote": "In general, caution should be exercised in the administration of lamivudine in elderly patients reflecting the greater frequency of decreased hepatic, renal, or cardiac function, and of concomitant disease or other drug therapy [see Dosage and Administration ( 2.3 ), Clinical Pharmacology ( 12.3 )].",
